    14→//! ## Upload Processing Model
    15→//!
    16→//! Garmin Connect uses **synchronous** upload processing, unlike Strava which
    17→//! processes uploads asynchronously:
    18→//!
    19→//! - **Garmin Connect**: The upload API immediately returns the activity ID
    20→//!   (or error) in the response. No status polling is required. The upload
    21→//!   completes in a single request/response cycle.
    22→//!
    23→//! - **Strava**: Returns an upload_id immediately, then processes the file
    24→//!   asynchronously. Requires calling `check_upload_status()` to poll for
    25→//!   completion.
    26→//!
    27→//! This means GarminClient does NOT need a `check_upload_status()` method.
    28→//! The `upload_activity()` method returns a `SyncRecord` with `status: Completed`
    29→//! when successful, or an error if the upload fails.
